#: app_ui/pages/settings.py:1011
msgid ""
"Added to the end of the chat system prompt, so it applies to every "
"conversation. Good for describing your archive — the kinds of documents "
"in it, your correspondents, how your reference numbers look — and for how"
" you want answers written. It cannot switch tools on or off, and it "
"cannot override the rules that keep the assistant from inventing document"
" IDs, amounts or dates."
msgstr ""
"Wird an das Ende des Chat-System-Prompts angehängt und gilt damit für "
"jede Unterhaltung. Gut geeignet, um dein Archiv zu beschreiben — welche "
"Arten von Dokumenten darin liegen, deine Korrespondenten, wie deine "
